§§ `My time limit -- Part 2 periods, ss 4, 6A, 6B`

#ASSERT `adult limit` `PI` (`d` 10 3 2020) EQUALS `last day` (`d` 10 3 2023)
#ASSERT `adult limit` `FAA` (`d` 1 7 2021) EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 7 2024)
#ASSERT `adult limit` `trespass to the person, assault, battery or imprisonment` (`d` 5 5 2022) EQUALS `last day` (`d` 5 5 2025)
#ASSERT `adult limit` `contribution between tortfeasors` (`d` 1 2 2023) EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 2 2025)
#ASSERT `adult limit` `deed` (`d` 1 1 2010) EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 1 2022)
#ASSERT `adult limit` `other` (`d` 29 2 2020) EQUALS `last day` (`d` 28 2 2026)
#ASSERT `adult limit` `land, a mortgage, defamation, an account, an equitable claim, tax or an arbitration` (`d` 1 1 2020) EQUALS `not answered by this encoding`
-- s 4(1): accrued the day before commencement day; on commencement day the Act applies.
#ASSERT `adult limit` `PI` (`d` 14 11 2005) EQUALS `the law before 15 November 2005 decides`
#ASSERT `adult limit` `PI` (`d` 15 11 2005) EQUALS `last day` (`d` 15 11 2008)
-- s 6A, s 90: no limitation period, however old the abuse; not for a Fatal Accidents Act claim (s 6A(6)).
#ASSERT `By when must I commence my action` `PI` TRUE FALSE (`d` 1 1 1975) (`d` 1 1 1965) FALSE 0 FALSE FALSE 0 FALSE FALSE `no date` EQUALS `no limitation period applies`
#ASSERT `By when must I commence my action` `trespass to the person, assault, battery or imprisonment` TRUE FALSE (`d` 1 1 2010) (`d` 1 1 1995) FALSE 0 FALSE FALSE 0 FALSE FALSE `no date` EQUALS `no limitation period applies`
#ASSERT `By when must I commence my action` `FAA` TRUE FALSE (`d` 1 7 2021) (`d` 1 1 1980) FALSE 0 FALSE FALSE 0 FALSE FALSE `no date` EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 7 2024)
-- s 6B: no limitation period for a subsequent dust disease action.
#ASSERT `By when must I commence my action` `PI` FALSE TRUE (`d` 1 3 2015) (`d` 1 1 1950) FALSE 0 FALSE FALSE 0 FALSE FALSE `no date` EQUALS `no limitation period applies`

§§ `My time limit -- under 18 at accrual (ss 30-33)`

-- Born 1 June 2010; injured at 5 on 1 June 2015: s 30, 6 years (Division 3's 3 years is not longer).
#ASSERT `minor limit` `PI` (`d` 1 6 2015) (`d` 1 6 2010) 0 FALSE EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 6 2021)
-- s 32: 100 days without a guardian add 100 days; 10,000 days are capped the day before the 21st birthday.
#ASSERT `minor limit` `PI` (`d` 1 6 2015) (`d` 1 6 2010) 100 FALSE EQUALS `last day` (`d` 9 9 2021)
#ASSERT `minor limit` `PI` (`d` 1 6 2015) (`d` 1 6 2010) 10000 FALSE EQUALS `last day` (`d` 31 5 2031)
-- s 30(2): a deed's 12 years are longer.
#ASSERT `minor limit` `deed` (`d` 1 6 2015) (`d` 1 6 2010) 0 FALSE EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 6 2027)
-- Born 1 June 2005: at 14 (1 January 2020) s 30 gives 6 years; on the 15th birthday (1 June 2020) s 31 gives until 21.
#ASSERT `minor limit` `PI` (`d` 1 1 2020) (`d` 1 6 2005) 0 FALSE EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 1 2026)
#ASSERT `minor limit` `PI` (`d` 1 6 2020) (`d` 1 6 2005) 0 FALSE EQUALS `last day` (`d` 31 5 2026)
#ASSERT `minor limit` `PI` (`d` 1 6 2021) (`d` 1 6 2005) 0 FALSE EQUALS `last day` (`d` 31 5 2026)
#ASSERT `minor limit` `PI` (`d` 1 1 2023) (`d` 1 6 2005) 0 FALSE EQUALS `last day` (`d` 31 5 2026)
-- s 31(2): the general 6 years of Division 2 are longer at 17.
#ASSERT `minor limit` `other` (`d` 1 6 2022) (`d` 1 6 2005) 0 FALSE EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 6 2028)
-- The 18th birthday: the day before, still under 18 (until 21); on it, an adult (3 years).
#ASSERT `minor limit` `PI` (`d` 31 5 2023) (`d` 1 6 2005) 0 FALSE EQUALS `last day` (`d` 31 5 2026)
#ASSERT `minor limit` `PI` (`d` 1 6 2023) (`d` 1 6 2005) 0 FALSE EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 6 2026)
-- s 33: a close relationship gives until the day before the 25th birthday; a deed's 12 years from 17 are longer.
#ASSERT `minor limit` `PI` (`d` 1 6 2015) (`d` 1 6 2010) 0 TRUE EQUALS `last day` (`d` 31 5 2035)
#ASSERT `minor limit` `PI` (`d` 1 6 2015) (`d` 1 6 2010) 500 TRUE EQUALS `last day` (`d` 31 5 2035)
#ASSERT `minor limit` `deed` (`d` 1 1 2023) (`d` 1 6 2005) 0 TRUE EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 1 2035)

§§ `My time limit -- mental disability (ss 35, 36), both (s 52), and s 53`

-- Injured 1 March 2020: no time without a guardian, 3 years.
#ASSERT `disabled limit` `PI` (`d` 1 3 2020) 0 FALSE FALSE `no date` EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 3 2023)
-- s 35: 365 days without a guardian, to 29 February 2024; 5,000 days capped at 12 years.
#ASSERT `disabled limit` `PI` (`d` 1 3 2020) 365 FALSE FALSE `no date` EQUALS `last day` (`d` 29 2 2024)
#ASSERT `disabled limit` `PI` (`d` 1 3 2020) 5000 FALSE FALSE `no date` EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 3 2032)
-- s 36: 3 years from the end of the relationship (1 July 2025); not ended: 30 years; ended late: capped at 30 years.
#ASSERT `disabled limit` `PI` (`d` 1 3 2020) 0 TRUE TRUE (`d` 1 7 2025) EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 7 2028)
#ASSERT `disabled limit` `PI` (`d` 1 3 2020) 0 TRUE FALSE `no date` EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 3 2050)
#ASSERT `disabled limit` `PI` (`d` 1 3 2020) 0 TRUE TRUE (`d` 1 7 2048) EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 3 2050)
-- s 36(2): a deed's 12 years (1 March 2032) are longer than 3 years from 1 January 2021.
#ASSERT `disabled limit` `deed` (`d` 1 3 2020) 0 TRUE TRUE (`d` 1 1 2021) EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 3 2032)
-- s 52: born 1 June 2010, injured 1 June 2015, later disabled: the longer of Division 1 (1 June 2021) and Division 2.
#ASSERT `By when must I commence my action` `PI` FALSE FALSE (`d` 1 6 2015) (`d` 1 6 2010) FALSE 0 FALSE TRUE 0 FALSE FALSE `no date` EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 6 2021)
#ASSERT `By when must I commence my action` `PI` FALSE FALSE (`d` 1 6 2015) (`d` 1 6 2010) FALSE 0 FALSE TRUE 0 TRUE TRUE (`d` 1 1 2030) EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 1 2033)
-- s 53: the claim came on the death of a child; the claimant's own youth gives no further time: 3 years.
#ASSERT `By when must I commence my action` `PI` FALSE FALSE (`d` 1 6 2015) (`d` 1 6 2010) TRUE 0 TRUE TRUE 0 FALSE FALSE `no date` EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 6 2018)

